<title>POLAND: PBR to lead Novita bond issue.</title>
<headline>PBR to lead Novita bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Development Bank (PBR) will lead and underwrite a convertible bond issue for carpet maker Novita SA, Novita said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It was the first announcement by Novita that it would issue a convertible bond. It gave no details about the size of the issue or the date.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
